                            \pgfpathlineto{\pgfpoint{\pgf@circ@res@left-\pgf@circ@res@other}{\pgf@circ@res@temp+\pgf@circ@res@up+(\pgf@circ@qfp@pin@shift-\the\pgf@circ@count@a)*\pgf@circ@res@step}}
